  sequenceDiagram
      participant BahmniMart as Bahmni Mart (cron every 15min)
      participant OMRS_DB as OpenMRS DB
      participant MartDB as Mart DB
      participant Metabase
      actor Analyst

      BahmniMart->>OMRS_DB: Read raw clinical data
      BahmniMart->>MartDB: Write flattened/denormalized tables

      Analyst->>Metabase: Open dashboard
      Metabase->>MartDB: SQL queries
      Metabase-->>Analyst: Charts & dashboards